  "title": "Configuring Email Outegration",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://help.zscaler.com/uvm/configuring-email-outegration",
    "node": "1546677",
    "revision": "3249212",
    "updated": "2026-10-20",
    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Email outegration is used to send email notifications from the Agentic Security Operations Platform (Agentic SecOps Platform) to specified recipients. You can configure the email format and map data to its fields."
    },
    {
      "text": "To configure email outegration:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Agentic SecOps Platform Admin Portal, click Configure.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          60
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, click Outegrations.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          35,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Create.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Connect a New Outegration page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          29
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Connect a New Outegration page, click Email.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          32
        ],
        [
          45,
          50
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Create Email Outegration page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          28
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Details section:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Display Name: Email appears in the field. You can enter a new name if necessary.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Active: Enable or disable to use the outegration in automation workflows.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Recipients: Enter email addresses for recipients. Press Enter to add multiple email addresses.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Test to verify the connection.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "After the connection is verified, click Next.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 7,
      "strong": [
        [
          40,
          44
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Advanced Settings section, from the Create email item from drop-down menu, select the primary entity to create the email for.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 8,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          24
        ],
        [
          43,
          65
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Map.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 9,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Data Mapping section:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 10,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Mapping.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "From the Select which field to populate drop-down menu, select an option (e.g., Subject, Body, or Recipients), then click Add Value to add a mapping value. To learn more, see Mapping Data Sources.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          9,
          39
        ],
        [
          80,
          87
        ],
        [
          89,
          93
        ],
        [
          98,
          108
        ],
        [
          122,
          131
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "(Optional) Click the More icon, and select the Set As Mandatory checkbox to make the field mandatory.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          21,
          25
        ],
        [
          47,
          63
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Repeat these steps to map other email fields.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Preview to review the email mapping.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Finish.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The email outegration is created and email will be sent to recipients as configured.",
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
}
